## Detector Design

### 1. BuildFailureRecurrenceDetector
- Trigger: sprint-lifecycle SPRINT_PHASE_CHANGE newPhase=EVALUATE
- Reads .tasks/*.result files, checks for tsc failures
- Reads .brain/sprints/ for historical data
- Alert if same file fails tsc 3+ sprints in a row

### 2. TokenSpikeDetector
- Trigger: sprint-lifecycle SPRINT_PHASE_CHANGE newPhase=RETRO
- Reads .tasks/*.result tokenUsage, sums total
- Compares against configurable threshold (default $50)
- Alert if cost > 2x average or absolute threshold exceeded

### 3. AgentRoutingAnomalyDetector
- Trigger: sprint-lifecycle SPRINT_PHASE_CHANGE newPhase=EVALUATE
- Reads .tasks/*.json, checks if any agent has >80% tasks
- Specifically enforces ADR-041 (test-writer 22/22 pattern prevention)

### 4. ScopeCollisionRateDetector
- Trigger: cron or filesystem events during EXECUTE phase
- Checks event payload for collision counts
- Alert if >10 collisions per sprint

### 5. NotificationDeliveryHealthDetector
- Trigger: cron events
- Checks event payload for notification delivery stats
- Alert if failure rate > 50% (nervous bridge broken)

## Verify Steps
1. tsc --noEmit → 0 errors
2. npx vitest run tests/nervous/detectors/ → all pass
